@hj-mistral can you check https://github.com/hj-mistral/vllm/pull/3/changes .
I feel like IMAGE_TAG + config are already a great way to disambiguate vllm instances; I feel the ignoring os/vllm.envs part is a bit cumbersome and we're likely better off with a simpler approach.
Lemme know if I missed something

